{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/74fd34d230b2a6ea76d6b2ce944c2ea7.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1536 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your new life! Build your dream farm, grow crops, raise animals, craft, mine, fish, and forge heartfelt connection with charming townsfolk. Enjoy changing seasons with new quests and festivals. Explore a vibrant world, level up your skills, uncover mysteries, and shape your own unforgettable story in this cozy farming / life sim RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/d8837df1d90e7e3cc9c8fdfa4e7e8645.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1024 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/dfb1551461f446e2a138730a3fed6dc6.poster.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/dfb1551461f446e2a138730a3fed6dc6.webm?t=1774027228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Turn your field into a thriving farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow different crops, craft useful machines and items, raise adorable animals, place buildings and your home anywhere on your farm, and customize them to suit your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/25e1a11374f7ac94bf5044a6967362da.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build relationships and start a family</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your perfect match among  dateable characters, each with their own unique personalities and heartwarming story cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/6f1e6eb20702df4111153394ae091df5.poster.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/6f1e6eb20702df4111153394ae091df5.webm?t=1774027228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Decorate your dream home and buildings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your home and buildings with hundreds of furniture and decor items. Let your creativity shine as you design the perfect space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/088bcf258280234e854f3ec51b46ef56.poster.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/088bcf258280234e854f3ec51b46ef56.webm?t=1774027228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Explore mysterious mines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into deep mines and dungeons packed with monsters, treasures, new environments, shiny gemstones, raw materials for crafting and upgrading tools, and hidden mysteries waiting to be uncovered.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/afb8a7b157f20e8e5baa7c9b484aedf8.poster.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/afb8a7b157f20e8e5baa7c9b484aedf8.webm?t=1774027228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become part of the local community</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know friendly villagers and follow their stories. Enjoy seasonal festivals, exciting events, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3469680?t=1774027228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3469680?t=1774027228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/d2c4b2e047b4f2e87bebef7e3a3516379ec22532/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774027228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/d2c4b2e047b4f2e87bebef7e3a3516379ec22532/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774027228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469680/extras/74fd34d230b2a6ea76d6b2ce944c2ea7.avif?t=1774027228\" width=1536 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your new life! Build your dream farm, grow crops, raise animals, craft, mine, fish, and forge heartfelt connection 